: The connection dies without saying so. Mid-turn the frames stop and the
: keep-alives stop with them, but the socket stays open — so there is no error,
: no close, and nothing to catch. Only the missing keep-alives separate this
: from the long pause in slow-thinking, which keeps sending them throughout.
:
: The stall outlasts any sane threshold. Playback continues server-side, so a
: client that notices and reconnects gets the rest of the answer.

