data: {"type": "assistant", "id": "a1", "content": "Three stand out, and the reason differs in each case.\n\n**Founder Stories (LinkedIn)** — €11.4k for four opportunities. The creative worked; the targeting did not, and it spent most of its budget on people who already knew us.\n\n**Retargeting — All Visitors** — €6.2k, almost all of it against a segment that had already converted. Narrow it or drop it.\n\n**Webinar Promotion (Q2)** — €4.8k and the strongest engagement of the three, but every opportunity it produced was already in an active sequence. It moved deals it did not create.\n\nThe first two are waste. The third is attribution — I would keep running it and stop crediting it."}

